{
  "_about": "Eval queries with attribute-based relevance labels. A song is relevant when it satisfies every key given in `relevant`: genres (any of), moods (primary mood or tag, any of), and numeric bounds. These are silver labels derived from catalog attributes, so they reward attribute fit, not taste.",
